\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Average per-recording wall-clock time per pipeline stage. The candidate-1 stage scales with the number of STT models. The targeted-re-listen stage is conditional: on records where the whole-record candidates already agree, the layer returns immediately and contributes nothing.}}{8}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
